:: Sister Kiss [interaction] {"position":"500,2400","size":"100,100"}
/* Intimate scene, reached from the "Kiss her" card of the NPC Interaction screen.
   The card's requirements and its once-per-day limit live in define_interactions.twee.
   Short placeholder: expand it however you like, the stat changes below are what the card promises. */
<<DisplayActivity $sister 500>>
She sees me coming and tilts her head, half amused and half wary, like she's waiting to see how far I'll actually go. I stop an arm's length away. She doesn't tell me to leave.

<<silently>>
<<set _msgs = [
  { who: $sister, text: "You're staring." },
  { who: $player, text: "Yeah, I am." },
  { who: $sister, text: "Are you going to say something or just keep doing that?" },
  { text: "I close the last of the distance instead. She goes still for a second, then kisses me back, quick and a little clumsy, like she's daring herself." },
  { who: $sister, text: "Okay. Wow. That was... okay." },
  { who: $player, text: "Just okay?" },
  { who: $sister, text: "Don't push your luck. And obviously, not a word to anyone." }
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>

She turns away fast, but not fast enough to hide the grin. I leave her pretending nothing happened.

<<UpdateStat "+" "SisterLust" 5>>
<<UpdateStat "+" "SisterCorruption" 3>>
<<UpdateStat "+" "SisterRelation" 2>>
<<UpdateStat "-" "SisterResistance" 2>>

